"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[51265],{51265:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/0755208f2a50987665d76afeec96d136.jpg\\"\\n          title=\\"Ajeossi Coffee\\"\\n          cuisine=\\"Cafe\\"\\n          address=\\"1 Meokja 1-gil, Gongju-si, Chungcheongnam-do\\"\\n          rating=4.0\\n          tags=\\"cafe\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\n\\nWhile taking a walk nearby after finishing lunch, I spotted a place that looked like it would obviously serve delicious coffee, so I stopped by for <mark>takeout</mark>.  \\n\\nIt had already been on my shortlist of cafes to check out while searching for good spots to visit in Gongju, so I walked right in without hesitation.  \\n\\nThe seating inside the cafe was quite compact, but since my plan was to get takeout from the beginning, it was not an issue at all.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nWhile waiting after placing my order at the counter, I looked around the interior for a moment; the space was charming, cozy, and beautifully decorated.  \\nAs an aside, they must have run out of ice at the time, because a staff member who seemed to be the owner\'s daughter hurried over to the convenience store right across the street to buy ice.  \\n\\nBefore long, my coffee was served, and its flavor was remarkably rich.  \\nIn particular, the deep, lingering <mark>coffee aroma</mark> was completely my style.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nIf there had been available seats and I had plenty of time, it would have been truly wonderful to stay and relax in the shop.  \\nIt is the kind of cafe I would love to drop by again whenever I visit Gongju in the future.\\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/0755208f2a50987665d76afeec96d136.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Ajeossi Coffee\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/849e02a105d453aaae68d62accef6822.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Ajeossi Coffee\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/a2dbb775b5ec893b5615bc3680d31fde.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Ajeossi Coffee\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/e2c97a399bb1e80c692754e635cf1a32.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Ajeossi Coffee\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/51d181068a3ff949f5da42e1fb995680.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Ajeossi Coffee\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/c4039dab3ac7d9134f5cffc1b8c60162.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Ajeossi Coffee\\">\\n</pictures>"}')}}]);